1
00:00:22,806 --> 00:00:26,690
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:33,705
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,578 --> 00:00:40,716
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,054 --> 00:00:47,063
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,274 --> 00:00:51,195
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,406 --> 00:00:54,497
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,794 --> 00:00:59,029
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,014 --> 00:01:03,922
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,220 --> 00:01:07,106
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,416 --> 00:01:12,198
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,198 --> 00:01:16,778
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,778 --> 00:01:18,777
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,980 --> 00:01:24,762
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,146 --> 00:01:29,457
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,457 --> 00:01:31,965
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,211 --> 00:01:42,428
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,878 --> 00:01:48,712
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,712 --> 00:01:51,630
=Episode 7=

19
00:02:06,519 --> 00:02:07,519
Congratulations!

20
00:02:07,519 --> 00:02:08,519
Congratulations!

21
00:02:15,759 --> 00:02:17,840
You look so handsome today.

22
00:02:19,039 --> 00:02:20,159
Don't stare at me.

23
00:02:20,919 --> 00:02:22,000
It's improper.

24
00:02:28,919 --> 00:02:29,919
Congratulations!

25
00:02:29,919 --> 00:02:31,741
Congratulations!

26
00:02:42,204 --> 00:02:43,204
Come in.

27
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,439
Congratulations!

28
00:02:46,439 --> 00:02:47,639
May you grow old together!

29
00:02:47,639 --> 00:02:48,840
Thank you, thank you.

30
00:02:48,873 --> 00:02:50,240
- Thank you.
- May you have children soon!

31
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,360
Thank you.

32
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:52,360
Thank you.

33
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:56,680
Can you stop looking like
you're about to crash the wedding?

34
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:59,280
Isn't your sister trying to
bond with Xu Xian?

35
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:01,520
Think of today as a rehearsal.

36
00:03:06,479 --> 00:03:07,919
You are so handsome.

37
00:03:08,319 --> 00:03:09,879
Would you like to be my partner?

38
00:03:15,599 --> 00:03:16,680
So thin-skinned?

39
00:03:16,879 --> 00:03:17,879
Too hard.

40
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,639
First bow to Heaven and Earth!

41
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,520
Second bow...

42
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:33,360
To Heaven and Earth this way!

43
00:03:36,199 --> 00:03:38,039
They should have left it
to professionals.

44
00:03:38,479 --> 00:03:39,639
This monk is so unprofessional.

45
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:44,080
Third bow...

46
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,840
Bow to each other!

47
00:04:10,879 --> 00:04:13,599
To the bridal chamber!

48
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:15,080
- Great!
- Wonderful!

49
00:04:32,759 --> 00:04:33,759
My dear...

50
00:04:34,199 --> 00:04:36,879
As of today, we are married.

51
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,040
My lady...

52
00:04:41,319 --> 00:04:42,319
Yes.

53
00:04:42,439 --> 00:04:44,439
What did you just call me?

54
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:47,959
My... my...

55
00:04:50,879 --> 00:04:51,920
Do I look that old to you?

56
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:53,959
No.

57
00:05:01,639 --> 00:05:04,639
Come, time for our nuptial wine.

58
00:05:06,399 --> 00:05:07,399
Right.

59
00:05:33,839 --> 00:05:36,600
Since we have drunk the nuptial wine,

60
00:05:36,879 --> 00:05:38,279
we are a real married couple now.

61
00:05:40,439 --> 00:05:43,360
We're just acting.
Don't take it seriously.

62
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:44,920
If we don't make it look real,

63
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:46,480
how can we fool the Rakshasa Bird?

64
00:05:52,279 --> 00:05:53,279
My dear...

65
00:05:54,079 --> 00:05:55,720
After drinking the nuptial wine,

66
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,160
next...

67
00:06:10,199 --> 00:06:11,199
My dear...

68
00:06:13,079 --> 00:06:14,079
My dear...

69
00:06:34,639 --> 00:06:37,360
Does it have to be so fast?

70
00:06:44,519 --> 00:06:47,079
Next, we should wait for our prey.

71
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:51,680
Or were you hoping to make it real?

72
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:53,240
Of course not.

73
00:06:55,959 --> 00:06:57,800
Commit to the bit.

74
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:01,079
I'm not going to eat you alive.

75
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:56,759
You really are a demon.

76
00:07:57,839 --> 00:07:58,920
You knew all along?

77
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:02,000
I only pretended to be close to you
these past few days

78
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:04,319
to verify your identity.

79
00:08:05,079 --> 00:08:07,000
Did you really think I fell for you?

80
00:08:07,759 --> 00:08:10,279
Snake demon, you killed my parents!

81
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,360
I will kill you!

82
00:08:12,879 --> 00:08:14,839
I didn't! I was undergoing
my tribulation that day.

83
00:08:14,839 --> 00:08:15,839
Pay for my parents' lives!

84
00:08:22,759 --> 00:08:23,759
Xu Xian!

85
00:08:29,319 --> 00:08:30,560
It really was you!

86
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,799
I don't remember anything from that day.

87
00:08:33,039 --> 00:08:34,480
There must be a misunderstanding!

88
00:08:34,759 --> 00:08:35,919
Only if I regain my memories...

89
00:08:36,279 --> 00:08:40,120
How could this pain compare to
what my parents suffered?

90
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:43,120
How could it compare to
the agonizing pain

91
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:45,639
I've endured every day and night
for over ten years?

92
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,639
This wedding night

93
00:08:59,759 --> 00:09:02,120
is my final gift to you.

94
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:32,320
Die in your dreams!

95
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:40,159
Just a vengeful spirit
Dare act wild before me?

96
00:09:44,879 --> 00:09:45,879
How is this possible?

97
00:09:46,559 --> 00:09:48,240
How could anyone escape my nightmare?

98
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:04,720
You petty Rakshasa bird, hiding in
dreams after death to harm people.

99
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:05,759
Stay out of this!

100
00:10:31,399 --> 00:10:33,000
Everyone here is fast asleep?

101
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:34,840
Yes.

102
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:35,840
Release them.

103
00:10:45,679 --> 00:10:46,919
With your meager power,

104
00:10:47,279 --> 00:10:48,720
if you don't want your soul shattered,

105
00:10:49,159 --> 00:10:50,320
I suggest you do as I told you.

106
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:53,720
Wait.

107
00:10:54,879 --> 00:10:56,399
(If I just break
the nightmare like this,)

108
00:10:56,399 --> 00:10:57,960
(Xu Xian will get suspicious
when he wakes up.)

109
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:01,840
Put on an act with me later.

110
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:19,000
What kind of world is this?

111
00:11:21,279 --> 00:11:22,960
All lovers must die!

112
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:26,240
All lovers must die!

113
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:31,000
Even in death, I'm being enslaved.

114
00:11:33,879 --> 00:11:36,039
All lovers must die!

115
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:48,480
Fahai!

116
00:11:49,399 --> 00:11:50,759
Impure earth, pure heaven.

117
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:52,039
Clear the mind, break the illusion!

118
00:11:56,639 --> 00:11:58,799
Oh no, we were trapped
in the spirit's illusion.

119
00:11:59,039 --> 00:12:00,039
She has already appeared.

120
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:05,279
Miss Bai! Miss Bai!

121
00:12:05,559 --> 00:12:06,559
Wake up.

122
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:08,360
She's here?

123
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:15,240
Die!

124
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:20,559
All lovers must die!

125
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:26,200
Miss Bai, stay here.

126
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:31,200
You should fight him a bit longer,

127
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:32,480
and then let yourself be captured.

128
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:33,600
Make it look convincing.

129
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:37,960
Just act like how you tried to
hurt people just now.

130
00:12:38,399 --> 00:12:41,799
Just don't let them see
that you fear me, got it?

131
00:12:43,759 --> 00:12:46,399
But don't actually hurt them.

132
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:48,399
Otherwise...

133
00:12:49,559 --> 00:12:51,960
Sweetie, a word of advice.

134
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:54,679
Don't ever believe in love.

135
00:13:14,679 --> 00:13:16,000
A monk from Jinshan Temple?

136
00:13:16,759 --> 00:13:19,000
Traitor, pay with your life!

137
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:34,360
I lost.

138
00:13:34,759 --> 00:13:36,279
Do whatever you want with me.

139
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:38,759
Ma'am, take a good look at me.

140
00:13:38,759 --> 00:13:40,639
Why are you attacking me?
Do I even know you?

141
00:13:41,159 --> 00:13:43,039
Everyone from Jinshan Temple
deserves to die!

142
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:45,600
We're not here for revenge.

143
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:47,240
We have some questions for you.

144
00:13:47,519 --> 00:13:48,519
About what?

145
00:13:49,440 --> 00:13:50,799
The groom who deceived you

146
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:52,919
and slaughtered

147
00:13:53,360 --> 00:13:54,399
your entire clan,

148
00:13:54,759 --> 00:13:55,759
who was he?

149
00:13:58,360 --> 00:13:59,360
The groom...

150
00:14:02,919 --> 00:14:04,600
(We met and fell in love
with each other.)

151
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:07,120
(He disregarded the boundary
between mortal and demon)

152
00:14:07,639 --> 00:14:09,879
(and swore to spend his life with me.)

153
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:14,360
(Yet he gouged out my core
with his own hands)

154
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:16,080
(and slaughtered my entire clan.)

155
00:14:16,519 --> 00:14:18,360
(All his elaborate schemes)

156
00:14:18,720 --> 00:14:22,039
(were just to steal the cores
of our Rakshasa clan.)

157
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:25,679
(The reason he played
such a grand scheme)

158
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:28,159
(and pretended to love me)

159
00:14:28,879 --> 00:14:31,279
(was that our Rakshasa cores,)

160
00:14:31,279 --> 00:14:34,399
(when filled with
utmost despair and sorrow,)

161
00:14:34,759 --> 00:14:37,759
(are most nourishing to cultivators.)

162
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:39,960
- Changming?
- Changming?

163
00:15:08,917 --> 00:15:13,076
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

164
00:15:15,543 --> 00:15:19,921
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

165
00:15:21,464 --> 00:15:27,289
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

166
00:15:28,058 --> 00:15:32,525
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

167
00:15:35,390 --> 00:15:39,831
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

168
00:15:42,027 --> 00:15:46,757
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

169
00:15:47,969 --> 00:15:54,082
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

170
00:15:54,745 --> 00:16:00,527
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

171
00:16:00,527 --> 00:16:06,790
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

172
00:16:07,100 --> 00:16:13,459
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

173
00:16:13,630 --> 00:16:20,997
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

174
00:16:21,282 --> 00:16:26,829
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

175
00:16:27,320 --> 00:16:33,530
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

176
00:16:33,840 --> 00:16:40,613
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

177
00:16:41,610 --> 00:16:47,263
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

178
00:16:48,097 --> 00:16:52,505
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

179
00:16:53,270 --> 00:16:55,858
♪Having ever loved♪
